cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IsaacSwim in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "IsaacSwim: underwater robotics simulator add-on for Isaac Sim"
abstract: >-
  Nvidia Isaac Sim offers a rich ecosystem of robotic simulation and learning features.
  However, it does not have hydrodynamics, buoyancy, underwater camera effects,
  and other components required for realistically simulating underwater robots.
  This project aims to create a feature rich underwater robotics focused add-on for Isaac Sim that enables
  it to be used for underwater robotics research,
  including batched reinforcement learning and underwater
  manipulation and navigation tasks.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chen
    given-names: Danyi
version: 0.1.1
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/danyichen/IsaacSwim"
keywords:
